# king_kong_pro 0.97 - PAD-420: one port per newest build, from this build's framework-generation draft and the same
# title's proven port, with other titles' feature lines taken out (docs/plans/pad420_mode_sweep.md).
# Emulator-proven 2026-10-07 by a build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play, the stock card, hidden, muted):
# the runtime hooked the game, 35 of its 55 shots came from their switches, a drain ended a ball,
# events seen firing: game_start, ball_start, ball_end, bonus_end, tilt_warning, tilt.
# Shots no press made: Shot 0x100, Shot 0x10000, Shot 0x100000, Shot 0x1000000, Shot 0x1000000000, Shot 0x10000000000000, Shot 0x20, Shot 0x20000, Shot 0x20000000000, Shot 0x200000000000, Shot 0x40, Shot 0x400, Shot 0x40000, Shot 0x40000000000, Shot 0x4000000000000, Shot 0x40000000000000, Shot 0x80, Shot 0x80000000000, Shot 0x8000000000000, Train lock opto.

